title: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Folded sections
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: The detail that is not needed at first sits in folded sections. Each shows its title and one summary line, and opens to the detail. The whole header row is one button. Nothing was removed: everything folded is one click or key press away.
dir: TD
also: 'Where the denial is weak' and 'The six ASAM dimensions' are not folded: each has its own 'Full summary' button and stays open.
---
start s1 "A denial is on screen (or its brief)"
screen f1 "Folded at first, each with a title, one summary line and a chevron\n'What the agents did': 'Reader, Advocate and Historian read the letter and the chart...' and the pill 'Done in 0:48'\n'What has happened': '6 steps. Latest, Mon 4:46 pm: ...'\n'Add a denial letter': 'Drop a letter or use a sample'\n'Why FLO suggests this': 'The reasons, from the chart and the clock. A recommendation, not a payer rule.'"
screen f2 "On the brief page\n'Key dates and numbers': 'Call: Wed 10/21, 9–11 am · Window: 36 h'\n'Have these open': '0 of 3 ticked' (and '1 of 3 ticked' after a tick)"
process pa "Each header is a real button with aria-expanded=false\nSummary lines are worked out from the denial, so they change when it does"

click c1 "Click a header, or Tab to it and press Enter or Space"
process p1 "aria-expanded becomes true\nChevron turns over, a rule appears, the detail shows below"
screen d1 "'What the agents did': one line per agent with a tick\n'What has happened': 'Every step is also on the Dashboard.' and the timeline\n'Why FLO suggests this': the reasons\n'Key dates and numbers': two columns\n'Have these open': one tick box per source"
screen d2 "'Add a denial letter': drop area, 'Use sample letter', note box, 'Analyze the denial'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Add a denial letter"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Recommended next step"
goto g3 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › The brief"

click c2 "Click the header again, or press Enter or Space"
process p2 "aria-expanded becomes false\nThe detail hides"
process p3 "'Add a denial letter' stays in the page while closed\nA typed note, a chosen file and a running analysis survive closing it"
process p4 "On the brief, 'Key dates and numbers' and 'Have these open' also stay in the page while closed\nPrint opens both on paper and drops the chevron"
process p5 "Esc closes menus, dialogs and drawers, not a folded section"
process p6 "Opening one does not close another\nA section starts closed again each time the page is opened"
end e1 "Section is closed again"

s1 --> f1 --> pa
s1 --> f2 --> pa
pa --> c1 --> p1
p1 --> d1
p1 --> d2 --> g1
d1 --> g2
d1 --> g3
d1 --> c2 --> p2 --> e1
d2 --> c2
p2 -.-> p3
p2 -.-> p4
p1 -.-> p6
c1 -.-> p5
